# In avg_ratio matrix we'll collect the surface layer/bulk volume average ratios
# for all the 120 bins of file VMind (old PVD).
# Four collections are available, corresponding to the four columns of avg_ratio defined below
# (the matrix is reshaped to 4:120 at the end).
# Column 1 : averaged on 109 carbon models (including H atoms when present);
# Column 2 : average on 109 carbon models (only C atoms considered) ;
# Column 3 : average on 109 carbon and 6 zeolite models (including H atoms in carbon models);
# Column 4 : average on 109 carbon and 6 zeolite models (only C atoms considered in carbon models)

